{
 "component": "collector-host",
 "title": "A host the collector cannot fully evaluate never fails the run (collector-protocol §5): a probe value that is not a date is a narrow gap for the checks reading it, a missing exec program (no powershell on a local Windows profile) is a host gap; every other host and check still reports",
 "contract": "collector-protocol/1.0 / findings/1.2",
